authorizedTransfer
function authorizedTransfer(address from, address to, uint256 amount) external returns (bool)
Transfers an amount of aTokens between two users. This function can only be called by the RWAaTokenManager address holding the 
ATOKEN_ADMIN_ROLE
 to granularly manage aToken-specific transfers. It is intended for administrative actions, such as migrating a user's position to a new wallet. The transfer is still subject to the protocol's health factor checks.

